Source: zellij
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: zellij
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: terminal workspace with batteries included
 Zellij is a terminal multiplexer written in Rust. It provides a layout
 system, built-in WASM plugins (status bar, tab bar, file manager), session
 resurrection, and web client support, all usable without configuration.
